Package: IKUNML
Title: Configurable Machine Learning Feature Selection for Omics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Weigen", "Wu", email = "weigenwu@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Weigen Wu
Maintainer: Weigen Wu <weigenwu@example.com>
Description: A lightweight toolkit for configurable feature selection in
    transcriptomic and other omics-style classification data. IKUNML wraps
    LASSO/elastic net, Boruta, SVM-RFE, random forest, gradient boosting,
    decision trees, XGBoost, caret RFE, and genetic algorithm feature selection
    behind a common interface, then summarizes overlaps across methods and
    supports reporting, stability selection, model validation, and nested
    cross-validation workflows.
